#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/op/gemm/gemm_tcgen05/index.rst:37
msgid ""
"Supports the SS (Shared-Shared) and TS (TensorMemory-Shared) variants, as "
"well as block-scaled MXFP8 GEMM when SFA/SFB scale factors are present. "
"Layout inference and lowering are dispatched based on the memory scopes of "
"operands A and B."
msgstr ""

