#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/op/gemm/gemm_tcgen05/index.rst:58
msgid ""
"For SS: both A and B get swizzled shared-memory layouts. For TS: A and C get "
"TMEM store layouts, B gets a swizzled shared-memory layout. For block-"
"scaled: same as SS (A and B get swizzle, C gets TMEM store layout)."
msgstr ""

